Description: Provides tools to evaluate the topology of alignment gaps and 
    residues using unweighted pair group method with arithmetic mean (UPGMA) 
    clustering and dynamic tree-cutting. It generates both distance dendrograms 
    and alignment diagrams for structural pattern analysis.
